  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      49.44,
      320.98,
      456.93,
      336.17
    ],
    "text": "For Multi-day boats in the West-Central Bay of Bengal deep sea areas.",
    "fonts": [
      "Cambria,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.479999542236328,
      12.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      36.0,
      352.85,
      564.53,
      410.57
    ],
    "text": "The Severe Cyclonic Storm \u201cAkvan\u201d over the west-central Bay of Bengal moved northwards with the speed of 17 kmph during past 06 hours and lay centered, near Latitude 15.4\u00b0N and Longitude 85.2\u00b0E (approximately 830 km northeast to Kankesanthurai) at around 11.30 a.m. today (19th November 2026).",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold",
      "Cambria"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.039999961853027,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      36.0,
      427.25,
      562.12,
      456.05
    ],
    "text": "Continuing to move north-northwestward, it is likely to cross Andhra Pradesh coasts between Narsapur and Puri, India around 11.30 am of 20th November.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      36.0,
      474.91,
      562.02,
      520.63
    ],
    "text": "Therefore, Naval and fishing communities are warned not to venture to the deep-sea areas bounded by 12N-20N and 80E-93E, until further notice. Further, Naval and fishing communities operating in those sea areas are advised to move to safe areas.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      36.0,
      533.47,
      561.72,
      562.27
    ],
    "text": "The naval and fishing communities, are requested to be attentive to the future forecasts and bulletins issued by the Department of Meteorology in this regard.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
